  "5bf6fd89-2d5b-40fc-8e23-0b76b7726717"],
 " reads its density and the two measures."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"d7b000c1-fd09-46c1-b4a8-b76c6038df1f"]
}, Open  ]],

